    "contentHtml": "<body><div><p>今天，我们推出 <strong>Unsloth Studio</strong> （测试版）：一个开源、无需代码的网页用户界面，用于在一个统一的 <strong> 本地 </strong> 界面中训练、运行和导出开源模型。</p> <p><a aria-label=\"Quickstart\" href=\"/docs/new/studio#quickstart\"><span>Quickstart</span></a> <a aria-label=\"Features\" href=\"/docs/new/studio#features\"><span>Features</span></a> <a aria-label=\"Github\" href=\"https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth\"><span>Github</span></a></p> <ul><li><p><font lang=\"zh-CN\"><font>在 Mac、Windows、Linux 上本地运行 GGUF 和 safetensor 模型</font></font></p></li> <li><p>训练500多个模型，速度提升2倍，显存减少70%（无精度损失）</p></li> <li><p>运行和训练文本、视觉、TTS 音频、嵌入模型</p></li></ul> <img alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1405\" srcset=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FxV1PO5DbF3ksB51nE2Tw%252Fmore%2520cropped%2520ui%2520for%2520homepage.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3Df75942c9-3d8d-4b59-8ba2-1a4a38de1b86&amp;width=400&amp;dpr=1&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=a663c397&amp;sv=2 400w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FxV1PO5DbF3ksB51nE2Tw%252Fmore%2520cropped%2520ui%2520for%2520homepage.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3Df75942c9-3d8d-4b59-8ba2-1a4a38de1b86&amp;width=400&amp;dpr=2&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=a663c397&amp;sv=2 800w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FxV1PO5DbF3ksB51nE2Tw%252Fmore%2520cropped%2520ui%2520for%2520homepage.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3Df75942c9-3d8d-4b59-8ba2-1a4a38de1b86&amp;width=400&amp;dpr=3&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=a663c397&amp;sv=2 1200w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FxV1PO5DbF3ksB51nE2Tw%252Fmore%2520cropped%2520ui%2520for%2520homepage.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3Df75942c9-3d8d-4b59-8ba2-1a4a38de1b86&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=1&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=a663c397&amp;sv=2 768w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FxV1PO5DbF3ksB51nE2Tw%252Fmore%2520cropped%2520ui%2520for%2520homepage.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3Df75942c9-3d8d-4b59-8ba2-1a4a38de1b86&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=2&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=a663c397&amp;sv=2 1536w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FxV1PO5DbF3ksB51nE2Tw%252Fmore%2520cropped%2520ui%2520for%2520homepage.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3Df75942c9-3d8d-4b59-8ba2-1a4a38de1b86&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=3&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=a663c397&amp;sv=2 2304w\" src=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FxV1PO5DbF3ksB51nE2Tw%252Fmore%2520cropped%2520ui%2520for%2520homepage.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3Df75942c9-3d8d-4b59-8ba2-1a4a38de1b86&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=3&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=a663c397&amp;sv=2\"> <ul><li><p><font lang=\"zh-CN\"><font>macOS 和 CPU 适用于 Chat GGUF 推理。MLX 训练即将推出。</font></font></p></li> <li><p>无需数据集。 <a href=\"/docs/new/studio/data-recipe\"><strong> 自动创建数据集 </strong></a> from <strong>PDF、CSV、JSON、DOCX、TXT</strong> 文件。</p></li> <li><p><font lang=\"zh-CN\"><font>导出或保存你的模型到 GGUF、16 位 safetensor 等格式。</font></font></p></li> <li><p><a href=\"/docs/new/studio/chat#auto-healing-tool-calling\"><strong>自修复工具调用 </strong></a> / 网络搜索 + <a href=\"/docs/new/studio/chat#code-execution\"><strong> 代码执行</strong></a></p></li> <li><p><a href=\"/docs/new/studio/chat#auto-parameter-tuning\">自动推理参数 </a> 调整和编辑聊天模板</p></li></ul> <h2>⭐ Features</h2> <p><a href=\"/docs/new/studio/chat\">搜索并运行 GGUF</a> 和 safetensor 模型，借助 <a href=\"/docs/new/studio/chat#auto-healing-tool-calling\"> 自修复工具 </a> 进行调用/网络搜索、 <a href=\"/docs/new/studio/chat#auto-parameter-tuning\"> 自动推理 </a> 参数调优、 <a href=\"/docs/new/studio/chat#code-execution\"><strong> 代码执行 </strong></a> 以及 API（很快）。上传图像、文档、音频、代码文件。</p> <p><font lang=\"zh-CN\"><font><font><a href=\"/docs/new/studio#model-arena\">并排对比模型 </a>. 由 llama.cpp 和 Hugging Face 驱动，我们支持  多 GPU 推理  和大多数模型。</font></font></font></p> <img alt=\"\" width=\"1615\" height=\"1178\" srcset=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FFeQ0UUlnjXkDdqhcWglh%252Fskinny%2520studio%2520chat.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3Dc2ee045f-c243-4024-a8e4-bb4dbe7bae79&amp;width=400&amp;dpr=1&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=da6aaad2&amp;sv=2 400w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FFeQ0UUlnjXkDdqhcWglh%252Fskinny%2520studio%2520chat.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3Dc2ee045f-c243-4024-a8e4-bb4dbe7bae79&amp;width=400&amp;dpr=2&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=da6aaad2&amp;sv=2 800w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FFeQ0UUlnjXkDdqhcWglh%252Fskinny%2520studio%2520chat.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3Dc2ee045f-c243-4024-a8e4-bb4dbe7bae79&amp;width=400&amp;dpr=3&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=da6aaad2&amp;sv=2 1200w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FFeQ0UUlnjXkDdqhcWglh%252Fskinny%2520studio%2520chat.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3Dc2ee045f-c243-4024-a8e4-bb4dbe7bae79&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=1&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=da6aaad2&amp;sv=2 768w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FFeQ0UUlnjXkDdqhcWglh%252Fskinny%2520studio%2520chat.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3Dc2ee045f-c243-4024-a8e4-bb4dbe7bae79&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=2&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=da6aaad2&amp;sv=2 1536w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FFeQ0UUlnjXkDdqhcWglh%252Fskinny%2520studio%2520chat.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3Dc2ee045f-c243-4024-a8e4-bb4dbe7bae79&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=3&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=da6aaad2&amp;sv=2 2304w\" src=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FFeQ0UUlnjXkDdqhcWglh%252Fskinny%2520studio%2520chat.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3Dc2ee045f-c243-4024-a8e4-bb4dbe7bae79&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=3&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=da6aaad2&amp;sv=2\"> <h3>No-code training</h3> <p><a href=\"/docs/new/studio#data-recipes\">上传 PDF、CSV、JSON</a> 文档，或 YAML 配置文件，然后在 NVIDIA 上立即开始训练。Unsloth 的内核优化了 LoRA、FP8、FFT、PT，适用于 500 多种文本、视觉、文本转语音/音频和嵌入模型。</p> <p>微调最新的 LLMs，如 <a href=\"/docs/models/qwen3.5/fine-tune\">Qwen3.5</a> 和 NVIDIA <a href=\"/docs/models/nemotron-3\">Nemotron 3</a> 。 <a href=\"/docs/basics/multi-gpu-training-with-unsloth\">Multi-GPU</a> 自动工作，新版本即将推出。</p> <img alt=\"\" width=\"1515\" height=\"1120\" srcset=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FRjAfHShyL7MfHfq6BStl%252Fonboarding%2520updated.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3D7cdde1a0-8f8c-4d25-9414-e28f35f211cd&amp;width=400&amp;dpr=1&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=64f27432&amp;sv=2 400w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FRjAfHShyL7MfHfq6BStl%252Fonboarding%2520updated.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3D7cdde1a0-8f8c-4d25-9414-e28f35f211cd&amp;width=400&amp;dpr=2&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=64f27432&amp;sv=2 800w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FRjAfHShyL7MfHfq6BStl%252Fonboarding%2520updated.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3D7cdde1a0-8f8c-4d25-9414-e28f35f211cd&amp;width=400&amp;dpr=3&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=64f27432&amp;sv=2 1200w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FRjAfHShyL7MfHfq6BStl%252Fonboarding%2520updated.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3D7cdde1a0-8f8c-4d25-9414-e28f35f211cd&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=1&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=64f27432&amp;sv=2 768w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FRjAfHShyL7MfHfq6BStl%252Fonboarding%2520updated.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3D7cdde1a0-8f8c-4d25-9414-e28f35f211cd&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=2&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=64f27432&amp;sv=2 1536w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FRjAfHShyL7MfHfq6BStl%252Fonboarding%2520updated.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3D7cdde1a0-8f8c-4d25-9414-e28f35f211cd&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=3&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=64f27432&amp;sv=2 2304w\" src=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252FRjAfHShyL7MfHfq6BStl%252Fonboarding%2520updated.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3D7cdde1a0-8f8c-4d25-9414-e28f35f211cd&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=3&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=64f27432&amp;sv=2\"> <h3>Data Recipes</h3> <p><a href=\"/docs/new/studio/data-recipe\"><strong>数据食谱 </strong></a> 将您的文档转换为可用的/合成数据集，通过图节点工作流实现。上传非结构化或结构化文件，如 PDF、CSV 和 JSON。Unsloth 数据食谱，由 NVIDIA <a href=\"https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/DataDesigner\">DataDesigner</a> 提供支持，自动将文档转换为您所需的格式。</p> <img alt=\"\" width=\"2416\" height=\"1618\" srcset=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252Fcc9T0V8WsyjcuOE2sIVV%252Fdata%2520recipes%2520longer.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3D5ae33e8d-09b1-45e0-8f5c-40dca8bbcf0c&amp;width=400&amp;dpr=1&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=db94261d&amp;sv=2 400w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252Fcc9T0V8WsyjcuOE2sIVV%252Fdata%2520recipes%2520longer.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3D5ae33e8d-09b1-45e0-8f5c-40dca8bbcf0c&amp;width=400&amp;dpr=2&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=db94261d&amp;sv=2 800w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252Fcc9T0V8WsyjcuOE2sIVV%252Fdata%2520recipes%2520longer.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3D5ae33e8d-09b1-45e0-8f5c-40dca8bbcf0c&amp;width=400&amp;dpr=3&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=db94261d&amp;sv=2 1200w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252Fcc9T0V8WsyjcuOE2sIVV%252Fdata%2520recipes%2520longer.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3D5ae33e8d-09b1-45e0-8f5c-40dca8bbcf0c&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=1&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=db94261d&amp;sv=2 768w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252Fcc9T0V8WsyjcuOE2sIVV%252Fdata%2520recipes%2520longer.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3D5ae33e8d-09b1-45e0-8f5c-40dca8bbcf0c&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=2&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=db94261d&amp;sv=2 1536w, https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252Fcc9T0V8WsyjcuOE2sIVV%252Fdata%2520recipes%2520longer.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3D5ae33e8d-09b1-45e0-8f5c-40dca8bbcf0c&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=3&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=db94261d&amp;sv=2 2304w\" src=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQFQ2Zq%252Fuploads%252Fcc9T0V8WsyjcuOE2sIVV%252Fdata%2520recipes%2520longer.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3D5ae33e8d-09b1-45e0-8f5c-40dca8bbcf0c&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=3&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=db94261d&amp;sv=2\"> <h3>Observability</h3> <p>Gain <a href=\"/docs/new/studio/start#training-progress\">complete visibility</a> into and control over your training runs. Track training loss, gradient norms, and GPU utilization in real time, and customize to your liking.</p><p>你甚至可以在其他设备上查看训练进度，比如你的手机。</p> <img alt=\"\" width=\"1760\" height=\"1256\" srcset=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F3215535692-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252FxhOjnexMCB3dmuQF